REM plan-89-A: an exported function whose parameter and return type are the
REM opaque built-in `AttributedString`. Building this package encodes the type's
REM wire id (11) into the `.mfp`; the acceptance harness re-decodes it into the
REM `.info` golden, proving the encode/decode round-trip.

EXPORT FUNC wrap(a AS AttributedString) AS AttributedString
  RETURN a
END FUNC
